  "description": "This delightful 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home perfectly blends comfort and modern living. Situated in a family-friendly neighborhood, this property is conveniently located near schools, parks, shopping centers, and public transport, making it easy to enjoy everything Alkimos has to offer, and only a 5 minute drive to the beach!<br/><br/>Property Features<br/>• Master bedroom with dual walk-in wardrobes and ensuite bathroom<br/>• Two additional bedrooms both with built-in robes and shared access to second bathroom<br/>• Functional main bathroom with shower/bath<br/>• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area<br/>• Well-appointed kitchen with modern stainless steel appliances<br/>• Paved outdoor area<br/>• Double remote garage/Access from the rear<br/>• Walking distance from the supermarket, daycare, primary school and park.<br/><br/>Register your interest NOW - This one will not last.<br/><br/>**Please do not apply prior to inspecting the property**",
